00:02:53,793 --> 00:02:59,793
The superhero movie to end all superhero movies. Hopefully.

2
00:05:47,586 --> 00:05:53,586
Teen Titans Go! To the Movies is a animation, action,
comedy film directed by Aaron Horvath.

3
00:08:41,379 --> 00:08:47,379
All the major DC superheroes are starring in their own films, all but the Teen Titans, so Robin is determined
to remedy this situation by getting over his role as a sidekick and becoming a movie star.

4
00:11:35,172 --> 00:11:41,172
Thus, with a few madcap ideas and an inspirational song in their hearts,
the Teen Titans head to Hollywood to fulfill their dreams.

5
00:14:28,965 --> 00:14:34,965
Beast Boy (voice), played by Greg Cipes.

6
00:17:22,758 --> 00:17:28,758
Robin (voice), played by Scott Menville.

7
