11
00:31:51,724 --> 00:31:57,724
Teen Titans Go!

12
00:34:45,517 --> 00:34:51,517
To the Movies is a 2018 American animated superhero musical comedy film
featuring the DC Comics superhero team, the Teen Titans.

13
00:37:39,310 --> 00:37:45,310
Based on the Cartoon Network animated television series Teen
Titans Go!, it was produced by Warner Bros.

14
00:40:33,103 --> 00:40:39,103
Animation and DC Entertainment and distributed by Warner Bros.

15
00:43:26,896 --> 00:43:32,896
The film was directed by Peter Rida Michail and Aaron Horvath
and written by Michael Jelenic and Horvath.

16
00:46:20,689 --> 00:46:26,689
It features the voices of Greg Cipes, Scott Menville, Khary Payton, Tara Strong, and Hynden Walch, reprising their respective
roles from the series, while Will Arnett  and Kristen Bell join the cast, with the former serving as a producer.

17
00:49:14,482 --> 00:49:20,482
Taking place during the events of the fifth season of the television series, the film follows the Teen Titans,
who attempt to have a movie made about them in Hollywood while dealing with supervillain Slade.

18
00:52:08,275 --> 00:52:14,275
Warner Bros.

19
00:55:02,068 --> 00:55:08,068
Pictures first announced the film in September 2017 with the
series' voice cast set to reprise their roles.

20
00:57:55,862 --> 00:58:01,862
Arnett and Bell were added to the cast in leading roles a month later.

21
01:00:49,655 --> 01:00:55,655
Teen Titans Go!

22
01:03:43,448 --> 01:03:49,448
To the Movies premiered in the TCL Chinese Theatre on July 22,
2018, and was theatrically released by Warner Bros.

23
01:06:37,241 --> 01:06:43,241
Pictures in the United States on July 27, 2018.

24
01:09:31,034 --> 01:09:37,034
It grossed $52.1 million worldwide on a $10 million budget.

25
01:12:24,827 --> 01:12:30,827
It received positive reviews from critics, who praised the
story, humor, music, and entertainment value.

26
01:15:18,620 --> 01:15:24,620
This is one of the posthumous releases for longtime DC producer
Benjamin Melniker, who died five months before its release.

27
01:18:12,413 --> 01:18:18,413
The film explores themes of movie business, superhero,
time travel, slapstick comedy, hollywood.

28
01:21:06,206 --> 01:21:12,206
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
